	Section:
		Text: Barcodes
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Linear formats
		Paragraph: Three formats draw one row of bars, 0.33 mm per module and 22.85 mm high at their natural size. `code-128` takes printable ASCII, up to 80 characters. `gs1-128` takes GS1 data and `ean-13` takes 12 digits (the engine adds the check digit) or 13 (it checks it).
